00:02:23.109 --> 00:02:24.277
Yeah, it's a slight benefit
for us.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.312
-We are scaling so much larger.
-We're trying a different tactic

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.948
from the one that didn't work
for 60 fuckin' years.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.650
-(APPLAUSE)
-What a crazy idea.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.820
The tactic is we have one big
carrot to offer

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.455
that is normalizing
relationships

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:38.291
and actually offering them
the huge economic opportunities

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:39.859
