-Ending the embargo

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:42.428
-would be another big carrot.
-SALAM:<i> Yeah.</i>

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:43.897
But we're not doing that

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:46.332
even though most Americans
are for doing that.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:48.134
Normalizing relations
