gonna be there. They're gonna

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.611
-meet Americans.
<i>-And that's worked</i>

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:00.713
in Putin's Russia?
That's worked, you know,

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:02.315
that's gonna work in Iran?
That's gonna work

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:03.850
in all the other authoritarian
countries

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:06.386
